# ── Secrets — MUST NOT be baked into image layers ────────────────────────────
# Dockerfile uses `COPY . .`, so anything not excluded here is permanently
# embedded in a pushed, tagged image layer and cannot be retracted after the
# fact. Secrets are supplied at RUNTIME via the mounted secrets directory
# (see docker-compose.yml: COMSERV_SECRETS_DIR -> /home/comserv/.comserv/secrets:ro).
db_config.json
*db_config*.json
.comserv/
**/secrets/
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
id_rsa*
ssh_credentials.json
.env*
